WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.725
Do you know how we currently run

00:00:02.745 --> 00:00:04.462
our SALARY CYCLE?

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.670
Let's start with how it works today.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.847
Today, our cycle runs

00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:12.166
from JANUARY to DECEMBER

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:15.221
12 months, one cycle.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:16.739
MERIT

00:00:16.758 --> 00:00:19.480
Expected market movement

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.606
based on projected market

00:00:21.626 --> 00:00:23.728
and inflation trends

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.148
Salary market data becomes

00:00:26.168 --> 00:00:28.607
available around NOVEMBER

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:29.916
BONUS

00:00:29.936 --> 00:00:33.800
Estimated Company Performance KPIs

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.704
based on the information

00:00:35.724 --> 00:00:37.787
available by DECEMBER

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.351
Now, we're moving to a new cycle.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:44.548
From APRIL to MARCH

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.299
It changes WHEN the

00:00:47.319 --> 00:00:49.857
information arrives

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:51.164
By JANUARY

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:54.373
actual Company Performance

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.008
And by FEBRUARY

00:00:56.028 --> 00:00:58.661
actual market movement

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:03.580
Closer to market best practice

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.196
Decisions rest on more relevant,

00:01:06.216 --> 00:01:08.104
actual information

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.607
Merit increases and promotions

00:01:11.627 --> 00:01:14.150
take effect on APRIL 1

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:17.229
That's where the cycle now begins.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:18.775
BONUS

00:01:18.795 --> 00:01:21.855
paid in the MARCH payroll

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:23.924
MARCH is the last month

00:01:23.944 --> 00:01:25.346
of the cycle

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.952
One thing that isn't changing

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:30.911
Your PERFORMANCE APPRAISAL

00:01:30.931 --> 00:01:33.000
stays on the same schedule

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:34.656
and it will still close

00:01:34.676 --> 00:01:35.976
in DECEMBER

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:37.910
One more thing -

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.329
and it happens only once

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:44.192
IMPLEMENTATION YEAR ONLY:

00:01:44.212 --> 00:01:48.013
15 months instead of 12

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:50.933
ILLUSTRATIVE EXAMPLE

00:01:50.953 --> 00:01:53.540
a 5% merit increase

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:58.040
5% ÷ 12 = 0.4167%

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:00.640
per month

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.570
Multiply that by 15 months

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:06.852
and the equivalent becomes

00:02:06.872 --> 00:02:08.314
6.25%

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:12.005
The merit percentage hasn't changed -

00:02:12.025 --> 00:02:14.729
only the months it covers

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:18.130
APRIL to MARCH

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:20.584
That's the one to remember.

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:23.190
Have questions?

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:26.067
Please contact your HR personnel

00:02:26.087 --> 00:02:27.537
for support.
